212:  * available.
213:  * \note Inspired by Marlin's fast dequantization, but here we don't have to permute
214:  * weights order.
215:  * \ref
216:  * https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/6dffa4b0a6120159ef2fe44d695a46817aff65bc/csrc/quantization/fp8/fp8_marlin.cu#L120
